noVNC v1.7.0, https://github.com/novnc/noVNC/tree/v1.7.0
Core and vendor sources are included under their original licenses.
TwinDesk changes in core/rfb.js: only ARD security type 30 is accepted; clear account credentials after creating the ARD response.
Source archive SHA-256: b1003a11b6e6e8d8f7f5e5586daae7f8ca651d8aee0aa155ff9ac841c48f52c6
AUTHORS: removed trailing whitespace.
ARD startup is guarded against asynchronous/fragmented re-entry; repeated credential requests are handled by the local page.
Dispatches a one-time twindeskframe event after the first decoded nonempty framebuffer rectangle.
Dispatches twindeskdraw when the decoded framebuffer first reaches a nonempty canvas draw.
Supports an optional, validated primary-display viewport while retaining remote input coordinates.
Supports pausing framebuffer updates while the normal viewer is active and refreshing on resume.
